'''Glisten''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Pearls Bundle]] during the [[Summer Event 2024]]. However the effect is no longer obtainable as the gamepass has gone offsale

== Appearance ==
It shares the exact same effect trail as [[Sunbeams]] but, instead of being yellow, the overall color scheme of the effect is blue and pink. When a player is killed by a knife with this effect, their dead body will emit a beaming blue & pink glow, as well as sparkles.

== Trivia ==

* This is the only item within the [[Pearls Bundle]] that cannot be purchased from a separate gamepass.
* This is the fourth godly effect to be introduced into the game, following [[Flow]], [[Darkswirl]], and [[Flowerwood (Effect)|Flowerwood]].

